  "worked_solution": "Recall that the equation of a parabolic cylinder, whose axis is the $z$-axis, is given by\n\n$$\n{x}^{2}=4py,\n$$\n\nand a parabolic cylinder, shifted ${x}_{0}$ along the x-axis and ${y}_{0}$ along the y-axis, is given by\n\n$$\n(x-{x}_{0})^{2}=4p(y-{y}_{0}).\n$$\n\nThus, our equation is a parabolic cylinder with the following parameters:\n\n$$\n({x}_{0},{y}_{0})=(-2,0),\\,p=-\\frac{1}{4}.\n$$",
